=\"M20.59 13.41 13.42 20.58a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0L2 12V2h10l8.59 8.59a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.82z\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"1.4\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"/></svg></span><div><strong>Materialen</strong><p>42%   Katoen · 41% Polyester · 14% Nylon · 3% Spandex</p></div></div><div class=\"hi-g2-info-row\"><span class=\"hi-g2-info-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"5\" width=\"14\" height=\"11\"/><path d=\"M15 9h4l3 3v4h-7z\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/></svg></span><div><strong>Verzending &amp; retour</strong><p>Besteld? Binnen 1 werkdag verzonden <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Meer info</a>. 30 dagen retour via <a href=\"https://www-higrip-nl.myparcel.me/returns/create\" target=\"_blank\">deze link</a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"hi-g2-info-row\"><span class=\"hi-g2-info-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12\"/></svg></span><div><strong>Voor jouw sport</strong><p>Voetbal, pilates, tennis, hardlopen en meer. <a href=\"/pages/ontdek-jouw-sport\">Ontdek jouw sport</a>.</p></div></div></div>\n{%- endif -%}\n{{ 'overflow-list.css' | asset_url | preload_tag: as: 'style' }}\n{{ 'base.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag: preload: true }}\n{{ 'hi-sale-price.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}\n{%- comment -%} HÏ Grip custom — hier houden, niet in sections/product-information.liquid (wordt overschreven bij Horizon-updates) {%- endcomment -%}\n{%- if template.name == 'product' -%}\n  {{ 'product-improvements.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}\n{%- endif -%}"
